 ow Raids every weekend from October 7\, 2026 to November 3\, 2026. If you
 ’re lucky\, you may encounter Shiny Shadow Landorus (Incarnate Forme)!\n
 \n━━ RAIDS ━━\n▸ Appearing in 5-Star Shadow Raids\nShadow Landor
 us (Incarnate Forme) will appear in Shadow Raids.\nPokémon: Landorus (Inc
 arnate)\n\n━━ SHINY ━━\nIf you’re lucky\, you may encounter Shin
 y Shadow Landorus (Incarnate Forme)!\nPokémon: Landorus (Incarnate)\n\n
 🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/shadow-landorus-incarnate-forme-in-shadow
 -raids-october-2026/
