DTSTART:20261027T210000Z
DTEND:20261103T210000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Master League and Mega Halloween Cup: Great League Edition 
 will run from October 27\, 2026\, at 1:00 p.m. to November 3\, 2026\, at 1
 :00 p.m. PT.\nTrainers will also receive 4× Stardust from win rewards (th
 is does not include end-of-set rewards).\n\n▸ Master League\n• All Pok
 émon are eligible.\n\n▸ Mega Halloween Cup: Great League Edition\n• P
 okémon must be at or below 1\,500 CP to enter.\n• Mega-Evolved Pokémon
  are allowed.\n• Only Bug-\, Poison-\, Ghost-\, Dark-\, and Fairy-type P
 okémon are eligible.\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/gbl-twilight-tra
 ils_master-league_mega-halloween-cup-great-league-edition/
