BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:into-the-wild-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261126T235103Z
SUMMARY:Into the Wild 2026
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261109T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261113T200000
DESCRIPTION:It’s time to head back Into the Wild for a Steel- and Dragon-
 type adventure! Regidrago makes its Dynamax debut in five-star Max Battles
 \, Dynamax Meltan debuts in GO Pass: Into the Wild\, and Crowned Sword Zac
 ian and Crowned Shield Zamazenta take over five-star raids as Pokémon GO 
 Wild Area 2026 approaches.\n\n▸ Related Events\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\
 n• Remote Raid limit increased to 30 from Monday\, November 9\, to Frida
 y\, November 13\, 2026\n• No Remote Raid limit from Saturday\, November 
 14\, to Sunday\, November 15\, 2026\n• Chance to encounter Shiny Gimmigh
 oul when using a Coin Bag*\n• Chance to encounter Shiny Meltan when open
 ing the Mystery Box*\n• Reduced wait time before you can open the Myster
 y Box again*\n• Trainers can receive special event stickers from PokéSt
 ops and Gifts\n* These bonuses will be available from Monday\, November 9\
 , at 10:00 a.m. to Sunday\, November 15\, 2026\, at 6:00 p.m. local time.\
 nDaily Discoveries will not take place from November 9 through November 15
 \, 2026.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Dynamax Pokémon Debuts\nRegidrago
  will make its Pokémon GO Dynamax debut in five-star Max Battles\, and Me
 ltan will make its Dynamax debut in GO Pass: Into the Wild. If you’re lu
 cky\, you may encounter a Shiny one!\nPokémon: Regidrago\, Meltan\n\n▸ 
 Meltan and the Mystery Box\nThe Mystery Box is the key to catching Meltan.
  You can get one by sending a Pokémon from Pokémon GO to Pokémon HOME\,
  or to Pokémon: Let’s Go\, Pikachu! or Pokémon: Let’s Go\, Eevee! on
  Nintendo Switch.\nFrom Monday\, November 9\, at 10:00 a.m. to Sunday\, No
 vember 15\, at 6:00 p.m. local time\, opening the Mystery Box gives you a 
 chance to encounter Shiny Meltan\, and you won’t have to wait as long be
 fore you can open it again.\n\n▸ New Special Background!\nTrainers who t
 ake part in five-star raids and five-star Max Battles during the Into the 
 Wild event will have a chance of receiving a new Special Background after 
 a successful catch. The souvenir background appears on the Pokémon’s su
 mmary page\, showing when it was caught on the road to Pokémon GO Wild Ar
 ea!\n\n▸ Into the Wild Global Challenge\nWork with Trainers around the w
 orld to complete raids and Max Battles. Completing the Into the Wild Globa
 l Challenge unlocks the following bonuses.\n• The Adventure Effect for C
 rowned Sword Zacian’s Behemoth Blade will be more effective.\n• The Ad
 venture Effect for Crowned Shield Zamazenta’s Behemoth Bash will be more
  effective.\n• Energy collected during Max Battles will fill the meter f
 aster.\n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━\nThe following Pokémon will appear more fr
 equently in the wild\, along with other event-themed Pokémon.\nPokémon: 
 Galarian Meowth\, Magnemite\, Horsea\, Scyther\, Dratini\, Mareep\, Mawile
 \, Aron\, Bagon\, Skrelp\, Noibat\, Togedemaru\n\n━━ RAIDS ━━\nThe
  following Pokémon will appear in raids. Crowned Sword Zacian and Crowned
  Shield Zamazenta will also be featured in Raid Hours from 6:00 p.m. to 7:
 00 p.m. local time on Monday\, November 9\, and Tuesday\, November 10\, re
 spectively.\nDefeating Crowned Sword Zacian or Crowned Shield Zamazenta in
  raids will earn you Crowned Sword Energy or Crowned Shield Energy\, respe
 ctively.\n\n▸ Three-Star Raids\nPokémon: Druddigon\n100% IV CP\nPokémo
 n: Orthworm\n100% IV CP\n\n▸ Five-Star Raids\nPokémon: Zacian (Crowned 
 Sword)\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Zamazenta (Crowned Shield)\n100% IV CP\n\n
 ▸ Raid Hour: Monday\, November 9\nPokémon: Zacian (Crowned Sword)\n100%
  IV CP\n\n▸ Raid Hour: Tuesday\, November 10\nPokémon: Zamazenta (Crown
 ed Shield)\n100% IV CP\n\n━━ MAX BATTLES ━━\nThe following Dynamax
  Pokémon will appear in Max Battles. Pokémon appearing in five-star Max 
 Battles will also be featured in Max Battles from 6:00 p.m. to 7:00 p.m. l
 ocal time for one day each on the following schedule.\n\n▸ One-Star Max 
 Battles\nPokémon: Ralts\n100% IV CP\n\n▸ Two-Star Max Battles\nPokémon
 : Machop\n100% IV CP\n\n▸ Five-Star Max Battles: Wednesday\, November 11
 \nPokémon: Registeel\n100% IV CP\n\n▸ Five-Star Max Battles: Thursday\,
  November 12\nPokémon: Regidrago\n100% IV CP\n\n▸ Five-Star Max Battles
 : Friday\, November 13\nPokémon: Latias\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Latios\n10
 0% IV CP\n\n━━ MOVES ━━\n▸ Featured Attacks\n\n▸ Registeel\nRe
 gisteel caught during the event will know the Fast Attack Metal Claw.\nPok
 émon: Registeel\n\n▸ Latias\nLatias caught during the event will know t
 he Charged Attack Mist Ball.\nPokémon: Latias\n\n▸ Latios\nLatios caugh
 t during the event will know the Charged Attack Luster Purge.\nPokémon: L
 atios\n\n▸ Regidrago\nRegidrago caught during the event will know the Fa
 st Attack Dragon Breath.\nPokémon: Regidrago\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\n
 ▸ Field Research Tasks\nPokémon GO Wild Area–themed Field Research ta
 sks will be available throughout the event! Complete the research tasks to
  earn encounters with event-themed Pokémon and other rewards.\n• Power 
 up Steel‑type Pokémon 5 times → Aron\, Magnemite\, Togedemaru\, Galar
 ian Meowth\n• Power up Dragon‑type Pokémon 5 times → Bagon\, Skrelp
 \, Dratini\, Horsea\n• Win a raid → Dratini\, Rare Candy ×2\, Scyther
 \n• Catch 10 Pokémon → Horsea\, Aron\, Skrelp\, Magnemite\n• Win a 
 Max Battle → Bagon\, Mawile\n• Catch a Dynamax Machop → Machop Candy
  ×25\, Stardust ×5000\n• Catch a Dynamax Ralts → Ralts Candy ×25\, 
 Stardust ×5000\n\n▸ Collection Challenge\nComplete the Into the Wild Co
 llection Challenge before it ends to earn an encounter with Dynamax Ralts\
 , 5\,000 XP\, and 5\,000 Stardust.\n\n━━ GO PASS ━━\n▸ GO Pass: 
 Into the Wild\nGO Pass: Into the Wild is a free progression track. Complet
 e Pass Tasks to collect GO Points\, increase your rank\, and unlock reward
 s.\nTrainers will receive the pass automatically on Monday\, November 9\, 
 at 10:00 a.m. local time. Earn points and rank up until Sunday\, November 
 15\, 2026\, at 6:00 p.m. local time.\nFrom Monday\, November 9\, to Friday
 \, November 13\, you can collect GO Points up to a daily cap. There’s no
  limit to the GO Points you can earn on Saturday and Sunday\, November 14 
 to 15!\n\n▸ GO Pass Deluxe\nUpgrade to GO Pass Deluxe: Into the Wild for
  US$14.99* for upgraded rewards. The GO Pass Deluxe: Into the Wild + 10 Ra
 nks option costs US$19.99* and grants enough GO Points to reach Rank 10.\n
 …
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/into-the-wild-2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
