 n five-star raid battles from November 9\, 2026 to November 13\, 2026\, du
 ring the Into the Wild event.\nThese raids start at 10:00 a.m. local time 
 on November 9 and end at 8:00 p.m. local time on November 13.\nDefeating Z
 acian (Crowned Sword) or Zamazenta (Crowned Shield) in raids will earn you
  Crowned Sword Energy or Crowned Shield Energy\, respectively.\n\n▸ Raid
