 s event is happening instead\, so there are no Max Monday-specific bonuses
 \, such as the guaranteed Rare Candy XL.\nAll Dynamax Pokémon that have p
 reviously appeared in Pokémon GO may appear in Max Battles during Dynamax
  Trails\, excluding Legendary and Mythical Pokémon:\nPokémon: Bulbasaur\
 , Charmander\, Squirtle\, Caterpie\, Pikachu\, Growlithe\, Abra\, Machop\,
