BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dynamax-trails-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261126T235103Z
SUMMARY:Dynamax Trails
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261116T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261123T200000
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a week of Max Battles! Dynamax Pokémon return\, 
 Max Particles are surging in the wild\, and Eternamax Eternatus returns to
  Power Spots during Dynamax Trails.\nThe Dynamax Trails event will take pl
 ace from November 16\, 2026 at 10 am to November 23\, 2026 at 8 pm local t
 ime.\n\n▸ Related Events\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\nThe following bonuses
  will be active during the event.\n• Chance to receive Max Particles whe
 n catching event-themed Pokémon in the wild or after Max Battles\n• Mor
 e Power Spots than usual will be active\nCatching Pokémon in the wild has
  a chance to award 10 Max Particles. These count toward your daily limit o
 f 800 Max Particles from Power Spots and exploring\, but wild catches will
  keep awarding Max Particles even after you reach that limit.\nMax Particl
 es cannot be obtained from catches with the Explorer Gadget or a Pokémon 
 GO Plus +.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Spotlight Hour\nGrookey\, Scorbu
 nny\, and Sobble will be featured during Pokémon Spotlight Hour on Novemb
 er 19\, 2026\, from 6 pm to 7 pm local time. The bonus will be 2× Catch C
 andy.\nPokémon: Grookey\, Scorbunny\, Sobble\n\n▸ Event-Themed Stickers
 \nGet event-themed stickers by spinning PokéStops\, opening Gifts\, purch
 asing them from the in-game shop\, and progressing through your GO Pass.\n
 \n━━ SPAWNS ━━\n▸ Wild Encounters\nEvent-themed Pokémon will ap
 pear in the wild\, including any Pokémon that has debuted in Dynamax Max 
 Battles\, excluding Legendary and Mythical Pokémon.\nPokémon: Bulbasaur\
 , Charmander\, Squirtle\, Caterpie\, Pikachu\, Growlithe\, Abra\, Machop\,
  Gastly\, Krabby\, Hitmonlee\, Hitmonchan\, Rhyhorn\, Chansey\, Electabuzz
 \, Magmar\, Magikarp\, Eevee\, Omanyte\, Kabuto\, Hoothoot\, Shuckle\, Sne
 asel\, Hitmontop\, Ralts\, Sableye\, Wailmer\, Trapinch\, Feebas\, Spheal\
 , Beldum\, Combee\, Pidove\, Roggenrola\, Woobat\, Drilbur\, Cottonee\, Da
 rumaka\, Trubbish\, Cryogonal\, Deino\, Inkay\, Bounsweet\, Passimian\, Dr
 ampa\, Grookey\, Scorbunny\, Sobble\, Skwovet\, Rookidee\, Wooloo\, Toxtri
 city (Amped Form)\, Toxtricity (Low Key Form)\, Sizzlipede\, Hatenna\, Fal
 inks\, Duraludon\n\n━━ MAX BATTLES ━━\nAll Dynamax Pokémon that h
 ave previously appeared in Pokémon GO may appear in Max Battles during th
 e event\, excluding Legendary and Mythical Pokémon.\nPokémon: Bulbasaur\
 n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Charmander\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Squirtle\n100% IV
  CP\nPokémon: Caterpie\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Pikachu\n100% IV CP\nPokém
 on: Growlithe\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Abra\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Machop\n1
 00% IV CP\nPokémon: Gastly\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Krabby\n100% IV CP\nPok
 émon: Hitmonlee\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Hitmonchan\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: 
 Rhyhorn\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Chansey\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Electabuzz\n
 100% IV CP\nPokémon: Magmar\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Magikarp\n100% IV CP\n
 Pokémon: Eevee\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Omanyte\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Kabu
 to\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Hoothoot\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Shuckle\n100% IV
  CP\nPokémon: Sneasel\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Hitmontop\n100% IV CP\nPoké
 mon: Ralts\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Sableye\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Wailmer\n
 100% IV CP\nPokémon: Trapinch\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Feebas\n100% IV CP\n
 Pokémon: Spheal\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Beldum\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Comb
 ee\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Pidove\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Roggenrola\n100% I
 V CP\nPokémon: Woobat\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Drilbur\n100% IV CP\nPokémo
 n: Cottonee\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Darumaka\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Trubbis
 h\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Cryogonal\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Deino\n100% IV C
 P\nPokémon: Inkay\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Bounsweet\n100% IV CP\nPokémon:
  Passimian\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Drampa\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Grookey\n1
 00% IV CP\nPokémon: Scorbunny\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Sobble\n100% IV CP\n
 Pokémon: Skwovet\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Rookidee\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: W
 ooloo\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Toxtricity (Amped Form)\n100% IV CP\nPokémon
 : Toxtricity (Low Key Form)\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Sizzlipede\n100% IV CP\
 nPokémon: Hatenna\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Falinks\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: D
 uraludon\n100% IV CP\n\n…\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\n▸ Field Research 
 Task Rewards\nComplete event-themed Field Research tasks to earn Stardust\
 , Eternatus Candy\, encounters with event-themed Pokémon\, and more.\n•
  Catch 8 Pokémon → Bulbasaur\, Charmander\, Squirtle\, Grookey\, Scorbu
 nny\, Sobble\n• Power up Pokémon 8 times → Magikarp\, Feebas\, Pinap 
 Berry ×3\n• Explore 1 km → Eevee\, Stardust ×2000\n• Win a Max Bat
 tle → Drampa\, Duraludon\, Eternatus Candy ×10\, Stardust ×2000\n• U
 nlock a Max Move → Eternatus Candy ×25\, Stardust ×5000\n• Make an E
 xcellent Throw → Eternatus Candy ×25\, Golden Razz Berry ×1\, Silver P
 inap Berry ×1\n\n━━ GO PASS ━━\n▸ GO Pass: Dynamax Trails\nGO P
 ass is a free\, limited-time progression track. Collect GO Points and comp
 lete Pass Tasks to rank up and earn rewards.\nTrainers will automatically 
 receive GO Pass: Dynamax Trails on November 16\, 2026\, at 10 am local tim
 e. GO Points can be collected through November 23\, 2026\, at 8 pm local t
 ime.\nTrainers\, reach Rank 1 in GO Pass: Into the Wild and claim the GO W
 ild Area 2026 purple tee to unlock GO Pass Deluxe: Dynamax Trails for free
 ! Doing so also grants you early access starting Saturday\, November 14\, 
 at 10:00 a.m. local time\, before the general launch on Monday\, November 
 16.\nGO Pass Deluxe is also available for US$4.99 (or the equivalent prici
 ng tier in your local currency)\, offering upgraded rewards and faster pro
 gression. Deluxe Trainers can claim rewards from both tracks\, including r
 ewards from ranks unlocked before upgrading.\nClaim all unlocked rewards b
 y November 25\, 2026\, at 8 pm local time\, before they expire.\n\n▸ Fea
 tured Pokémon and Rewards\nComplete Pass Tasks to earn:\n• Encounters w
 ith event-themed Dynamax Pokémon with a Special Background\n• An encoun
 ter with Eternatus\, or 100 Eternatus Candy if you have already caught Ete
 rnatus\n• Eternatus Candy and Candy XL\n• Rare Candy\n• Stardust\n
 • Event-themed stickers\n• Additional rewards\nPokémon: Eternatus\nEt
 ernatus can only be caught once during this event and requires much more C
 andy and Candy XL to power up due to its massive power. Trainers who have 
 already caught Eternatus will receive Candy to continue powering it up.\nG
 O Pass Deluxe also offers:\n…
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/dynamax-trails-2026/
