BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:duolingo-timed-research-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261126T235103Z
SUMMARY:Pokémon GO and Duolingo Timed Research
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261117T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261231T235900
DESCRIPTION:Pokémon GO and Duolingo are teaming up! Do at least one Duolin
 go lesson a day for seven days to earn an offer code for Timed Research in
  Pokémon GO. Complete the research to earn XP\, Stardust\, and encounters
  with Pikachu\, Meowth\, Chatot\, and Lucario that have a Special Backgrou
 nd.\nDuo’s Pokémon Party\, the limited-time Duolingo quest\, starts on 
 Tuesday\, November 17\, 2026\, at 10:00 a.m. JST (Monday\, November 16\, a
 t 5:00 p.m. PST).\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Duo’s Pokémon Party\nJ
 oin Duo’s Pokémon Party\, a limited-time quest\, on the latest version 
 of the Duolingo app. Do a lesson in any course to earn your first reward\,
  then earn a new reward each day that you do at least one lesson. Rewards 
 include up to four Pokémon suits for your Duolingo avatar and an offer co
 de for Timed Research in Pokémon GO.\n• Starts: Tuesday\, November 17\,
  2026\, at 10:00 a.m. JST (Monday\, November 16\, at 5:00 p.m. PST)\n• J
 oin by: Monday\, December 21\, 2026\, at 11:59 p.m. local time\n• Finish
  the quest and claim rewards by: Tuesday\, December 29\, 2026\, at 11:59 p
 .m. local time\n\n▸ How to Get the Timed Research\n• Join Duo’s Pok
 émon Party in Duolingo by December 21.\n• Do at least one lesson a day 
 on seven different days by December 29.\n• Redeem your offer code in the
  Pokémon GO Web Store.\nOffer codes are unique to each Duolingo learner\,
  so there is no shared code to redeem.\n\n▸ Language Tag\nSome Pokémon 
 from this Timed Research will have a new language tag on their summary pag
 e. Tap the tag to see the Pokémon’s name in other languages.\n\n━━ 
 RESEARCH ━━\nPractice a new language with Professor Willow while you c
 omplete Pokémon GO tasks. Choose a language\, and the research tasks will
  appear in that language. Look out for Professor Willow’s hints if you g
 et stuck on a task!\nComplete tasks to earn XP\, Stardust\, and encounters
  with the following Pokémon that have a Special Background.\nPokémon: Pi
 kachu\, Meowth\, Chatot\, Lucario\n\n▸ Choose a Path\nAfter you claim th
 e rewards from step 1\, choose a language path: English\, Chinese (Traditi
 onal)\, Hindi\, Spanish (Latin America)\, Spanish (Europe)\, French\, Port
 uguese (Brazil)\, Indonesian\, Russian\, German\, Japanese\, Turkish\, Kor
 ean\, Thai\, or Italian. The tasks for the rest of the research will appea
 r in that language. You can choose only one path\, and you’ll stay on it
  until the end of the research.\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/duolin
 go-timed-research-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/duolingo-timed-research-2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
