UID:pokemon-latin-america-international-championships-2027-timed-research-t
 witch-drops@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261126T235103Z
SUMMARY:Twitch Drops for 2027 Pokémon Latin America International Champion
 ships
DTSTART:20261120T120000Z
DTEND:20261122T230000Z
DESCRIPTION:Get codes for exclusive Timed Research and a Battle Bundle duri
 ng the 2027 Pokémon Latin America International Championships Twitch broa
 dcast.\nPsyRhino took home the gold at the 2026 Pokémon GO North America 
 International Championships with a powerful Shadow Samurott on their team.
  Watch the 2027 LAIC stream\, and you can get a Samurott inspired by PsyRh
 ino’s NAIC-winning team.\nTune in to Twitch.tv/PokemonGO on November 20 
 and 21\, or Twitch.tv/Pokemon on November 22\, and you’ll earn rewards t
 he longer you watch. Here’s what you can get:\nWatch for 30 minutes: Uni
 que Timed Research that includes the following.\n• An encounter with a S
 amurott inspired by PsyRhino’s NAIC-winning team\n• 20 Oshawott Candy\
 n• 20 Oshawott Candy XL\n• 10 Charged TMs\n• 10 Fast TMs\nWatch for 
 45 minutes: An LAIC Battle Bundle that includes the following.\n• 1 Elit
 e Charged TM\n• 1 Rare Candy XL\n• 25 Charged TMs\n• 25 Fast TMs\nTi
 med Research tasks must be completed and rewards claimed before Friday\, D
 ecember 4\, 2026\, at 12:00 p.m. PST.\nFind more information on the Timed 
 Research from the Twitch Drops in the Research section.\n\n▸ How to use 
 Twitch Drops\nYou can check your Twitch Drop progress by clicking the ches
 t icon in the chat.\nYour inventory at Pokémon Trainer Central will look 
 like this:\nRewards may take some time to appear\, so check back if you do
 n’t see them right away.\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\nTrainers who redeem 
 the live stream code will get exclusive Timed Research that honors PsyRhin
 o\, the 2026 Pokémon GO North America International Championships Champio
 n\, and Samurott\, a key Pokémon that helped them become Champion! Watch 
 for 30 minutes to unlock this two-step Timed Research.*\n\n▸ LAIC Battle
  Bundle\nTrainers who watch for 45 minutes will earn an additional LAIC Ba
 ttle Bundle containing the following items.*\n• 1 Elite Charged TM\n• 
 1 Rare Candy XL\n• 25 Charged TMs\n• 25 Fast TMs\n\n🔗 https://leekd
 uck.com/events/pokemon-latin-america-international-championships-2027-time
 d-research-twitch-drops/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/pokemon-latin-america-international-champio
 nships-2027-timed-research-twitch-drops/
