BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:twilight-wishes-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261126T235103Z
SUMMARY:Twilight Wishes
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261124T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261130T200000
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Twilight Wishes with Espeon wearing a sun scarf\, Umb
 reon wearing a moon scarf\, and Rockruff! Enjoy increased chances to encou
 nter Shiny Staryu and Shiny Elgyem\, event-themed raids and Field Research
 \, and rewards and bonuses from the event GO Pass.\nTwilight Wishes runs f
 rom Tuesday\, November 24\, at 10:00 a.m. to Monday\, November 30\, 2026\,
  at 8:00 p.m. local time.\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\n• Increased chance t
 o encounter Shiny Staryu and Shiny Elgyem\nPokémon: Shiny Staryu\, Shiny 
 Elgyem\nReach Major Milestones on the event GO Pass to unlock the followin
 g bonuses.\n\n▸ Tier 1 – Rank 1\n• Increased chance to get Lucky Pok
 émon in trades\n• Increased chance to become Lucky Friends\n\n▸ Tier 
 2 – Rank 10\n• 2× Stardust for catching Pokémon\n• GO Pass Deluxe:
  3× Stardust for catching Pokémon\nYou can also earn extra GO Points eac
 h day by winning raids\, hatching Eggs\, and catching Pokémon. See the GO
  Pass section for point values.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Featured Po
 kémon\nEspeon wearing a sun scarf\, Umbreon wearing a moon scarf\, and Ro
 ckruff are featured during Twilight Wishes. All three can be Shiny if you
 ’re lucky!\nPokémon: Espeon wearing a sun scarf\, Umbreon wearing a moo
 n scarf\, Rockruff\n\n▸ Explore with Decor\nStars will light up the in-g
 ame skies during Twilight Wishes\, with colorful decor to enjoy as you exp
 lore.\n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━\nStaryu and Elgyem have an increased chance 
 of being Shiny during the event.\nThe following Pokémon will appear in th
 e wild\, along with other event-themed Pokémon.\nPokémon: Clefairy\, Jig
 glypuff\, Staryu\, Chimecho\, Munna\, Elgyem\nIf you’re lucky\, you migh
 t also encounter Rockruff!\nPokémon: Rockruff\n\n━━ RAIDS ━━\n▸
  One-Star Raids\nPokémon: Sun Crown Pikachu\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Moon C
 rown Pikachu\n100% IV CP\n\n▸ Three-Star Raids\nPokémon: Day Scarf Espe
 on\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Night Scarf Umbreon\n100% IV CP\n\n▸ Five-Star
  Raids\n\n▸ November 24\, until 10:00 p.m. local time\nPokémon: Cressel
 ia\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Darkrai\n100% IV CP\n\n▸ November 25 at 6:00 a
 .m. to November 30 at 8:00 p.m. local time\nPokémon: Deoxys (Normal)\n100
 % IV CP\nPokémon: Deoxys (Defense)\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Deoxys (Attack)
 \n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Deoxys (Speed)\n100% IV CP\n\n▸ Mega Raids\nThe 
 following Mega Raid bosses are available throughout the event.\nPokémon: 
 Mega Beedrill\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Mega Houndoom\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: 
 Mega Sableye\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Mega Manectric\n100% IV CP\n\n━━ R
 ESEARCH ━━\n▸ Field Research Task Rewards\nComplete event-themed Fie
 ld Research tasks to earn Mega Energy and encounters with event-themed Pok
 émon\, including Staryu\, Elgyem\, and more!\nCelebrate the Twilight Trai
 ls Season finale with additional encounters featuring Pokémon from throug
 hout the Season. These Field Research rewards change during the event.\n\n
 ▸ November 24 at 10:00 a.m. to November 26 at 10:00 a.m. local time\n•
  Catch 10 Pokémon → Electrike\, Flamigo\, Flower Crown Cottonee\, Greav
 ard\n• Explore 1 km → Elgyem\, Staryu\n• Hatch an Egg → Maschiff\n
 • Spin a PokéStop you haven't visited before → Rare Candy XL ×1\, St
 ardust ×10000\n• Use a Lure Module at a PokéStop → Applin\n• Mega 
 Evolve a Pokémon → Beedrill Mega Energy ×25\, Houndoom Mega Energy ×2
 5\, Manectric Mega Energy ×25\, Sableye Mega Energy ×25\n\n▸ November 
 26 at 10:00 a.m. to November 30 at 8:00 p.m. local time\n• Catch 10 Pok
 émon → Electrike\, Flamigo\, Flower Crown Cottonee\, Greavard\n• Expl
 ore 1 km → Elgyem\, Staryu\n• Spin a PokéStop you haven't visited bef
 ore → Rare Candy XL ×1\, Stardust ×10000\n• Use an Incense → Bramb
 lin\n• Win a raid → Halloween Drifblim\, Spooky Festival Gengar\n• M
 ega Evolve a Pokémon → Beedrill Mega Energy ×25\, Houndoom Mega Energy
  ×25\, Manectric Mega Energy ×25\, Sableye Mega Energy ×25\n\n━━ GO
  PASS ━━\n▸ GO Pass: Twilight Wishes\nGO Pass: Twilight Wishes and G
 O Pass Deluxe are available from Tuesday\, November 24\, at 10:00 a.m. to 
 Monday\, November 30\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time. Trainers automatica
 lly receive the free pass when it begins. Complete Pass Tasks to collect G
 O Points\, increase your rank\, and earn rewards.\nGO Pass Deluxe costs US
 $4.99 (or the equivalent local pricing tier). It offers upgraded rewards a
 nd faster progression.\nFor US$6.99 (or the equivalent local pricing tier)
 \, GO Pass Deluxe + 6 Ranks also provides enough GO Points to reach Rank 7
 .\nDeluxe includes rewards from both tracks. You can upgrade while the pas
 s is available and claim rewards from ranks you have already unlocked. Ava
 ilability may vary by region.\nClaim all unlocked rewards by Wednesday\, D
 ecember 2\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time\, before they expire.\n\n▸ Fe
 atured Pokémon and Rewards\nThe event GO Pass features the following rewa
 rds:\n• Encounters with event-themed Pokémon\n• Star Piece\n• Rare 
 Candy\n• Mega Energy for Beedrill\, Houndoom\, Sableye\, and Manectric\n
 • Additional rewards\nTrainers who upgrade to GO Pass Deluxe can also ea
 rn:\n• Additional encounters with event-themed Pokémon\n• An event-th
 emed avatar pose\n• Star Pieces\n• Premium Battle Passes\n• Addition
 al rewards\nReach Major Milestones to unlock the Lucky Pokémon\, Lucky Fr
 iends\, and catch Stardust bonuses listed in the Bonuses section.\n\n▸ G
 O Pass Rewards\nComplete Pass Tasks to rank up and earn the following rewa
 rds. Ranks 31 through 60 award Stardust.\n\n▸ GO Pass: Twilight Wishes\n
 Rank up to encounter costumed Espeon and Umbreon and earn Mega Energy!\n
 • Spin 5 PokéStops or Gyms50 PTS\n• Catch 5 Pokémon50 PTS\n• Delux
 eCatch 10 Pokémon100 PTS\n• Win a raid100 PTS\n• Hatch an Egg40 PTS\n
 • Catch a Pokémon5 PTS\n\n━━ SHINY ━━\n▸ Increased Shiny Chan
 ces\nStaryu and Elgyem have an increased chance of being Shiny during Twil
 ight Wishes. Evolve them to get Shiny Starmie and Shiny Beheeyem.\nPokémo
 n: Staryu\, Starmie\, Elgyem\, Beheeyem\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/event
 s/twilight-wishes-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/twilight-wishes-2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
