UID:gbl-twilight-trails_master-league_mega-catch-cup-great-league-edition@p
 okemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261126T235103Z
SUMMARY:GBL: Master League and Mega Catch Cup: Great League Edition
DTSTART:20261124T210000Z
DTEND:20261201T210000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Master League and Mega Catch Cup: Great League Edition will
  run from November 24\, 2026\, at 1:00 p.m. to December 1\, 2026\, at 1:00
  p.m. PT.\nTrainers will also receive 4× Stardust from win rewards (this 
 does not include end-of-set rewards).\n\n▸ Master League\n• All Pokém
 on are eligible.\n\n▸ Mega Catch Cup: Great League Edition\n• Pokémon
  must be at or below 1\,500 CP to enter.\n• Mega-Evolved Pokémon are al
 lowed.\n• Only Pokémon caught during the Twilight Trails Season are eli
 gible.*\n• Mythical Pokémon are not eligible.\n*Pokémon must be caught
