BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tropical-paradise-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261126T235103Z
SUMMARY:Tropical Paradise
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261201T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261207T200000
DESCRIPTION:Pyukumuku makes its Pokémon GO debut\, and Mega Slowbro can re
 ach the Super Max Mega Level for the first time! Enjoy event-themed wild e
 ncounters\, raids\, and Field Research\, plus rewards and bonuses from the
  event GO Pass.\nTropical Paradise runs from Tuesday\, December 1\, at 10:
 00 a.m. to Monday\, December 7\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time.\n\n━━
  BONUSES ━━\nReach Major Milestones on GO Pass: Tropical Paradise to u
 nlock these bonuses.\n\n▸ Tier 1 – Rank 10\n• 2× Raid XP\n\n▸ Tie
 r 2 – Rank 20\n• 5× Mega Energy for exploring with Slowpoke\, Slowbro
 \, or Slowking as your buddy after Mega Evolving Slowbro at least once\n\n
 ━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Pokémon Debut\nPyukumuku\, originally discove
 red in the Alola region\, makes its Pokémon GO debut. It will be availabl
 e in three-star raids and from the event GO Pass\, and it can be Shiny if 
 you’re lucky!\nPokémon: Pyukumuku\n\n▸ Attack Availability Update\nSt
 arting with this event\, Pyukumuku can learn the Fast Attack Soak.\n• Tr
 ainer Battles: 6 power\n• Raid Battles: 6 power\n\n▸ Mega Slowbro: Sup
 er Max Level\nStarting with this event\, Mega Slowbro can reach Super Max 
 Level for the first time in Pokémon GO.\nPokémon: Mega Slowbro\nFirst\, 
 increase Slowbro’s Mega Level to Max\, the third level. To progress to S
 uper Max\, you’ll need to use Slowbro Mega Energy to power it up\; Mega 
 Evolving alone is not enough.\n\n▸ Chilling Water+\nSlowbro can now use 
 the additional Charged Attack Chilling Water+ while Mega Evolved. Its powe
 r increases with the Pokémon’s Mega Level.\n• Trainer Battles: 45 pow
 er and a guaranteed chance to decrease the opponent’s Attack by one stag
 e\n• Raid Battles: 160 power\n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━\nThe following Pok
 émon will appear in the wild\, along with other event-themed Pokémon.\nP
 okémon: Slowpoke\, Shellder\, Wingull\, Slakoth\nYou might even encounter
  Snorlax!\nPokémon: Snorlax\nAdditional Pokémon will be featured at diff
 erent times during the event.\n\n▸ December 4 at 10:00 a.m. to December 
 7 at 8:00 p.m. local time\nPokémon: Hoppip\, Lotad\, Shroomish\nYou might
  even encounter Alolan Exeggutor!\nPokémon: Alolan Exeggutor\n\n━━ RA
 IDS ━━\n▸ One-Star Raids\nPokémon: Alolan Diglett\n100% IV CP\nPok
 émon: Frillish (Female)\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Frillish (Male)\n100% IV C
 P\nPokémon: Sandygast\n100% IV CP\n\n▸ Three-Star Raids\nPokémon: Pyuk
 umuku\n100% IV CP\n\n▸ Mega Raids\nMega Slowbro is in Mega Raids from De
 cember 2 at 6:00 a.m. to December 8 at 10:00 p.m. local time.\nPokémon: M
 ega Slowbro\n100% IV CP\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\n▸ Field Research Task
  Rewards\nComplete event-themed Field Research tasks to earn Slowbro Mega 
 Energy and encounters with event-themed Pokémon\, including Psyduck\, Ten
 tacool\, Shellder\, and more!\nPokémon: Shellder\, Psyduck\, Tentacool\nT
 asks will be listed here when the event begins.\n\n━━ GO PASS ━━\n
 ▸ GO Pass: Tropical Paradise\nGO Pass: Tropical Paradise and GO Pass Del
 uxe are available from Tuesday\, December 1\, at 10:00 a.m. to Monday\, De
 cember 7\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time. Trainers automatically receive 
 the free pass when it begins. Complete Pass Tasks to collect GO Points\, i
 ncrease your rank\, and earn rewards.\nGO Pass Deluxe costs US$4.99 (or th
 e equivalent local pricing tier). It offers upgraded rewards and faster pr
 ogression.\nFor US$6.99 (or the equivalent local pricing tier)\, GO Pass D
 eluxe + 6 Ranks also provides enough GO Points to reach Rank 7.\nDeluxe in
 cludes rewards from both tracks. You can upgrade while the pass is availab
 le and claim rewards from ranks you have already unlocked. Availability ma
 y vary by region.\nClaim all unlocked rewards by Wednesday\, December 9\, 
 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time\, before they expire.\n\n▸ Featured Poké
 mon and Rewards\nThe event GO Pass features the following rewards:\n• En
 counters with event-themed Pokémon\n• Lucky Egg\n• Rare Candy\n• Sl
 owbro Mega Energy\n• Additional rewards\nTrainers who upgrade to GO Pass
  Deluxe can also earn:\n• Additional encounters with event-themed Pokém
 on\n• Incense\n• Slowbro Mega Energy\n• Premium Battle Passes\n• A
 dditional rewards\nReach Major Milestones to unlock the Raid XP and Mega E
 nergy bonuses listed in the Bonuses section. The full rank-by-rank reward 
 list will be added here when the pass begins.\n\n━━ SHINY ━━\nPyuk
 umuku will be available in its Shiny variant from its debut!\nPokémon: Py
 ukumuku\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/tropical-paradise-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/tropical-paradise-2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:go-pass-december-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261126T235103Z
SUMMARY:GO Pass: December
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261201T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20270105T100000
DESCRIPTION:Encounter Kyurem and hatch Eggs with the Timed Incubator in GO 
 Pass: December!\nThe GO Pass and GO Pass Deluxe for December will be avail
 able from December 1\, 2026 at 10:00 am to January 5\, 2027 at 10:00 am lo
 cal time.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ GO Pass and GO Pass Deluxe\nTrain
 ers will automatically receive GO Pass: December on Tuesday\, December 1\,
  at 10:00 a.m. local time. You can collect GO Points and rank up to get ad
 ditional rewards through Tuesday\, January 5\, 2027\, at 10:00 a.m. local 
 time.\nAdditionally\, from Saturday\, January 2\, 2027\, at 12:00 a.m. to 
 Sunday\, January 3\, 2027\, at 11:59 p.m. local time\, there’s no daily 
 limit for how many GO Points you can earn!\nFor US$7.99*\, Trainers can up
 grade to the GO Pass Deluxe\, a paid version of the GO Pass that offers up
 graded rewards and faster progression.\nFor US$9.99*\, Trainers can upgrad
 e to the GO Pass Deluxe + 10 Ranks to also automatically earn enough GO Po
 ints to reach Rank 11.\nWhile progressing through the GO Pass Deluxe\, you
 ’ll be able to claim all of the rewards from both the free GO Pass and G
 O Pass Deluxe. You can upgrade to a GO Pass Deluxe at any time and still c
 ollect rewards from previously unlocked ranks.\nRewards unlocked in the GO
  Pass will expire on Thursday\, January 7\, 2027\, at 10:00 a.m. local tim
 e\, so be sure to claim your rewards before they’re gone!\n\n▸ Feature
 d Pokémon and Rewards\nComplete Pass Tasks to rank up your GO Pass to ear
 n the following rewards.\n• Encounter with Kyurem*\n• Rare Candy XL\n
 • Premium Battle Pass\n• Lucky Egg\n• And even more goodies!\nTraine
 rs who upgrade to the GO Pass Deluxe can also earn the following rewards.\
 n• One Timed Incubator\n• One Super Incubator\n• Additional encounte
 rs with even more Pokémon!\n• And even more goodies!\n\n▸ Major Miles
 tone Bonuses\nReach Major Milestones on your GO Pass to unlock the followi
 ng bonuses.\n\n▸ Tier 1 – Rank 1\n• Increased XP from going up a Fri
 endship level\n• 2× Friendship bonus damage in raids\n\n▸ Tier 2 – 
 Rank 25\n• Open up to 40 Gifts per day\n• Receive up to 125 Gifts per 
 day from spinning PokéStop and Gym Photo Discs\n• Hold 10 more Gifts in
  your Item Bag\n\n▸ Tier 3 – Rank 50\n• 2× Daily Adventure Incense 
 duration\n\n▸ Tier 4 – Rank 75\n• Increased XP and Stardust from hat
 ching Eggs\n…\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/go-pass-december-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/go-pass-december-2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:season-25-daydream-destinations@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261126T235103Z
SUMMARY:Season: Daydream Destinations
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261201T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20270301T100000
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Pokémon GO: Daydream Destinations!\nIn Pokémon GO\
 , Seasons are periods of time that feature new events\, Pokémon debuts\, 
 and surprises that all follow a certain theme. As the Seasons change\, you
  may find different Pokémon appearing in your area and hatching from Eggs
 . Make sure to explore during each in-game Season to collect and train as 
 many different Pokémon as you can! You’ll also enjoy special bonuses as
  you do.\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\n▸ GO Pass Major Milestone Bonuses\nRe
 ach Major Milestones on your GO Pass to unlock the following bonuses. Once
  unlocked\, these bonuses will last until the current GO Pass ends!\n\n▸
  Rank 1\n• Increased XP from going up a Friendship level\n• 2× Friend
 ship bonus damage in raids\n\n▸ Rank 25\n• Increased limits on opening
  Gifts\, receiving Gifts from PokéStop and Gym Photo Discs\, and storing 
 Gifts\n\n▸ Rank 50\n• 2× Daily Adventure Incense duration\n\n▸ Rank
  75\n• Increased XP and Stardust from hatching Eggs\n\n━━ FEATURES 
 ━━\n▸ Pokémon GO Tour: Alola\nPokémon GO Tour returns in February 
 2027 with a trip to the Alola region!\n• Pokémon GO Tour: Alola – Los
  Angeles — Thursday\, February 19\, to Saturday\, February 21\, 2027\n
 • Pokémon GO Tour: Alola – Kaohsiung — Thursday\, February 19\, to 
 Saturday\, February 21\, 2027\n• Pokémon GO Tour: Alola – Global — 
 Saturday\, February 27\, and Sunday\, February 28\, 2027\nTrainers everywh
 ere can join the global event. A global event ticket\, available on the Po
 kémon GO Web Store\, will grant access to exclusive Special Research\, ad
 ditional bonuses\, and an increased chance to encounter Shiny Pokémon.\nC
 heck out our Los Angeles\, Kaohsiung\, and Global event pages for more det
 ails.\n\n▸ Mega-Evolved Pokémon\nMega Froslass and Mega Drampa will be 
 featured in Raid Day events during Daydream Destinations. Stay tuned for m
 ore details!\n\n▸ Community Days\nMark your calendar! Daydream Destinati
 ons will have Community Day events on the following dates.\n• December 1
 2–13\, 2026 — December Community Day\n• January 2\, 2027 — January
  Community Day Classic\n• January 16\, 2027 — January Community Day\n
 • February 6\, 2027 — February Community Day\n\n▸ GO Pass\nGO Pass\,
  a limited-time progression track\, will be available during Daydream Dest
 inations! Complete Pass Tasks to earn GO Points to increase your rank and 
 earn rewards.\nThe GO Pass Deluxe\, a paid version of the GO Pass\, will b
 e available for Trainers looking for upgraded rewards and faster progressi
 on.\n\n▸ GO Battle League\nThe GO Battle League continues during Daydrea
 m Destinations\, featuring the 2027 Europe International Championships Cup
 \, the Holiday Cup\, the Love Cup\, and more!\n\n▸ Research Breakthrough
 \nComplete Field Research to unlock Research Breakthrough encounters with 
 one of a variety of Season-themed Pokémon. Discover where your path leads
  you each week!\n\n━━ MAX BATTLES ━━\n▸ Dynamax Pokémon\nDynama
 x Alolan Sandshrew\, Dynamax Slowpoke\, Dynamax Corphish\, and more will m
 ake their way into Max Battles throughout the Season. Keep an eye out for 
 new Dynamax Pokémon at Power Spots!\nPokémon: Alolan Sandshrew\, Slowpok
 e\, Corphish\n\n▸ Gigantamax Pokémon\nGigantamax Inteleon and Gigantama
 x Toxtricity (Amped Form and Low Key Form) will be featured in Max Battle 
 Days during Daydream Destinations. Stay tuned for more details!\nPokémon:
  Gigantamax Inteleon\, Gigantamax Toxtricity\n\n━━ EGGS ━━\nHere a
 re some of the Pokémon hatching from Eggs this season.\nThere are more Po
 kémon appearing in Eggs than the ones listed.\n\n▸ In 2 km Eggs\nPokém
 on: Vulpix\, Swablu\, Yamper\n\n▸ In 5 km Eggs\nPokémon: Lickitung\, Sn
 om\, Flittle\n\n▸ In 5 km Eggs from Adventure Sync Rewards\nPokémon: Ty
 rogue\, Happiny\, Maschiff\n\n▸ In 7 km Eggs\nPokémon: Alolan Geodude\,
  Galarian Corsola\, Galarian Zigzagoon\n\n▸ In 7 km Eggs From Route Rewa
 rds\nThis type of Egg is obtained from Mateo’s Gift Exchange at the end 
 of a Route.\nPokémon: Hisuian Growlithe\, Hisuian Sneasel\, Galarian Cors
 ola\n\n▸ In 10 km Eggs\nPokémon: Honedge\, Goomy\, Charcadet\n\n▸ In 
 10 km Eggs from Adventure Sync Rewards\nPokémon: Gible\, Drampa\, Frigiba
 x\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/season-25-daydream-destinations/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/season-25-daydream-destinations/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
