BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:gigantamax-inteleon-max-battle-day-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261126T235103Z
SUMMARY:Gigantamax Inteleon Max Battle Day
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261205T140000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261205T170000
DESCRIPTION:The Gigantamax Inteleon Max Battle Day event will take place on
  December 5\, 2026 from 2 pm to 5 pm local time.\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\
 nThe following bonuses will be active during the event.\n• Max Particle 
 collection limit increased to 1\,600\n• All Power Spots will host Gigant
 amax Battles\n• Power Spots will refresh more frequently\n• Additional
  Power Spots will be active\n• 8× Max Particles from Power Spots\n• U
 p to three Special Trades for the day\n• From December 4 at 4:00 p.m. to
  December 5 at 8:00 p.m. PST (GMT −8)\, the daily Remote Raid limit will
  increase from 10 to 20\nThe following bonuses will be active on December 
 5\, 2026\, from 12:00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m. local time.\n• 2× Max Particles
  from exploring*\n• 1/4 Adventuring distance to receive Max Particles**\
 n*Trainers can collect Max Particles via the Nearby menu each day by explo
 ring. Adventure Sync can help make sure your distance counts! Keep an eye 
 on the Nearby menu for the icon that shows when Max Particles are ready to
  collect.\n**For these bonuses to apply\, Trainers must first collect all 
 Max Particles available in the Nearby menu.\n\n▸ Event Ticket\nFor US$4.
 99 (or the equivalent pricing tier in your local currency)\, you’ll be a
 ble to access event-exclusive Timed Research.\nTimed Research rewards incl
 ude the following.\n• 1 Max Mushroom\n• 25\,000 XP\n• 6\,400 Max Par
 ticles\nYou’ll also receive the following bonus.\n• 2× XP from Max Ba
 ttles\nThis Timed Research will be effective on Saturday\, December 5\, 20
 26\, from 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m. local time.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n
 ▸ Featured Pokémon\nThe following Pokémon will appear in six-star Max 
 Battles!\nPokémon: Gigantamax Inteleon\nFor the first time in Pokémon GO
 \, you’ll be able to encounter Shiny Gigantamax Inteleon—if you’re l
 ucky!\n\n▸ Where can I find Max Battles?\nMax Battles appear at Power Sp
 ots and require teamwork. Use the Pokémon GO Map to find active battles a
 nd locations where battles may appear during the event.\nYou can also chec
 k nearby events for community meetups hosted by Community Ambassadors\, or
  find your community to coordinate with other Trainers.\n\n━━ RESEARCH
  ━━\n▸ Paid Timed Research\nFor US$4.99 (or the equivalent pricing t
 ier in your local currency)\, you’ll be able to access event-exclusive T
 imed Research\, which rewards 1 Max Mushroom\, 25\,000 XP\, 6\,400 Max Par
 ticles\, and 2× XP from Max Battles.\nThe Timed Research is available on 
 Saturday\, December 5\, 2026\, from 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m. local time. Tas
 ks have not yet been announced.\n\n━━ SHINY ━━\nShiny Gigantamax I
 nteleon will be released with the start of the event.\nPokémon: Gigantama
 x Inteleon\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/gigantamax-inteleon-max-bat
 tle-day-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/gigantamax-inteleon-max-battle-day-2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
