BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pokemon-champions-celebration-event-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261126T235103Z
SUMMARY:Pokémon Champions Celebration Event 2026
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261208T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261214T200000
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Pokémon Champions in Pokémon GO with the Pokémon C
 hampions Celebration Event! Look for event-themed wild encounters\, raids 
 featuring Pokémon with a Special Background\, an event GO Pass\, and gift
 s for sending Pokémon from Pokémon HOME to visit Pokémon Champions.\n\n
 ━━ BONUSES ━━\n• Increased chance to encounter Kecleon at PokéS
 tops\nReach Major Milestones on your event GO Pass to unlock the following
  bonuses.\n\n▸ Tier 1 Bonus – Starting at Rank 1\n• 7× GO Transport
 er Energy gained per hour to send a Pokémon from Pokémon GO to Pokémon 
 HOME\n\n▸ Tier 2 Bonus – Starting at Rank 10\n• 2× Candy for catchi
 ng Pokémon*\n\n▸ Tier 3 Bonus – Starting at Rank 20\n• 3\,000 addit
 ional XP from completing Raid Battles\nUpgrade to the GO Pass Deluxe to al
 so get the following bonus:\n• GO Pass Deluxe: Receive up to two free Ra
 id Passes per day from spinning Gym Photo Discs\nKeep an eye out for addit
 ional bonus tasks for this GO Pass during the event!\n\n━━ FEATURES 
 ━━\n▸ Pokémon HOME and Pokémon Champions\nDuring the collaboration
  event period\, you can transfer a Pokémon caught in Pokémon GO to Poké
 mon HOME\, then send that Pokémon to visit Pokémon Champions to receive 
 a gift in your Pokémon Champions mailbox. See the Pokémon HOME news post
  for details.\n\n▸ Special Backgrounds\nPokémon encountered from raids 
 during the event may have a Special Background. Five-star raid bosses with
  the Special Background are only available for the duration of the Pokémo
 n Champions Celebration Event.\n\n▸ Stickers\nYou’ll be able to get ev
 ent-themed stickers by spinning PokéStops and opening Gifts.\n\n━━ SP
 AWNS ━━\n▸ Wild Encounters\nDuring the event\, Trainers may encounte
 r the following Pokémon and more in the wild.\nPokémon: Charmander\, Sta
 rly\, Grookey\nIf you’re lucky\, you might even encounter the following 
 and others!\nPokémon: Absol\, Gible\n\n━━ RAIDS ━━\nThe following
  Pokémon will appear in raids. If you’re lucky\, you might encounter a 
 Shiny one or one that has a Special Background!\n\n▸ One-Star Raids\nPok
 émon: Bagon\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Litten\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Frigibax
 \n100% IV CP\n\n▸ Three-Star Raids\nPokémon: Raichu\n100% IV CP\nPokém
 on: Garchomp\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Rillaboom\n100% IV CP\n\n▸ Five-Star
  Raids*\nPokémon: Latias\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Latios\n100% IV CP\nPoké
 mon: Heatran\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Cobalion\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Terrak
 ion\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Virizion\n100% IV CP\nPokémon: Regieleki\n100%
  IV CP\nPokémon: Regidrago\n100% IV CP\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\n▸ Fie
 ld Research\nEvent-themed Field Research tasks will be available! Complete
  Field Research tasks to earn Rare Candy.\n• ??? → Rare Candy ×?\n\n
 ━━ GO PASS ━━\n▸ GO Pass: Collaboration Celebration Event\nThe G
 O Pass and GO Pass Deluxe for the Pokémon Champions Celebration Event wil
 l be available from Tuesday\, December 8\, at 10:00 a.m. to Monday\, Decem
 ber 14\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time.\n\n▸ GO Pass and GO Pass Deluxe
 \nA GO Pass is a free\, limited-time progression track available during a 
 specified period. By collecting GO Points\, you can increase your rank to 
 earn rewards.\nTrainers will automatically receive GO Pass: Collaboration 
 Celebration Event on Tuesday\, December 8\, at 10:00 a.m. local time. You 
 can collect GO Points and rank up to get additional rewards through Monday
 \, December 14\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time.\nFor US$4.99*\, Trainers 
 can upgrade to the GO Pass Deluxe\, a paid version of the GO Pass that off
 ers upgraded rewards and faster progression.\nFor US$6.99*\, Trainers can 
 upgrade to the GO Pass Deluxe + 6 Ranks to also automatically earn enough 
 GO Points to reach Rank 7.\nWhile progressing through the GO Pass Deluxe\,
  you’ll be able to claim all of the rewards from both the free GO Pass a
 nd GO Pass Deluxe. You can upgrade to a GO Pass Deluxe at any time and sti
 ll collect rewards from previously unlocked ranks.\nRewards unlocked in th
 e GO Pass will expire on Wednesday\, December 16\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. loc
 al time\, so be sure to claim your rewards before they’re gone!\n\n▸ F
 eatured Pokémon and Rewards\nComplete Pass Tasks to rank up your GO Pass 
 to earn the following rewards.\n• Encounters with event-themed Pokémon\
 n• Golden Razz Berries\n• Silver Pinap Berries\n• Premium Battle Pas
 s\n• And even more goodies!\nTrainers who upgrade to the GO Pass Deluxe 
 can also earn the following rewards.\n• Additional encounters with even 
 more Pokémon!\n• Premium Battle Passes\n• Elite Charged TM\n• Rare 
 Candy XL\n• And even more goodies!\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/p
 okemon-champions-celebration-event-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/pokemon-champions-celebration-event-2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
