 re\, Catch\, or Battle. Your choice will shape the Timed Research tasks an
 d bonuses throughout the week.\nYou may have different research opportunit
 ies than other Trainers.\n\n▸ Related Events\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n
 ▸ Choose a Path\nYou can choose one of the following Timed Research path
 s:\n• Explore\n• Catch\n• Battle\nYour choice will determine your Ti
 med Research tasks and bonuses throughout the week. Specific bonuses have 
 not yet been announced.\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\n▸ Timed Research Deta
 ils\nTimed Research tasks and rewards will be added here when available.\n
