DESCRIPTION:The Great League: Mega Edition\, Ultra League: Mega Edition\, M
 aster League: Mega Edition\, and Mega Catch Cup: Great League Edition will
  run from February 23\, 2027\, at 1:00 p.m. to March 2\, 2027\, at 1:00 p.
 m. PT.\nTrainers will also receive 4× Stardust from win rewards (this doe
 s not include end-of-set rewards).\n\n▸ Great League: Mega Edition\n• 
 Pokémon must be at or below 1\,500 CP to enter.\n• Mega-Evolved Pokémo
 n are allowed.\n\n▸ Ultra League: Mega Edition\n• Pokémon must be at 
 or below 2\,500 CP to enter.\n• Mega-Evolved Pokémon are allowed.\n\n
 ▸ Master League: Mega Edition\n• No CP limit.\n• Mega-Evolved Pokém
 on are allowed.\n\n▸ Mega Catch Cup: Great League Edition\n• Pokémon 
 must be at or below 1\,500 CP to enter.\n• Mega-Evolved Pokémon are all
 owed.\n• Only Pokémon caught during the Daydream Destinations Season ar
 e eligible.*\n• Mythical Pokémon are not eligible.\n*Pokémon must be c
 aught between December 1\, 2026\, at 1:00 p.m. and March 2\, 2027\, at 1:0
 0 p.m. PST.\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/gbl-daydream-destinations_
 great-league-mega-edition_ultra-league-mega-edition_master-league-mega-edi
 tion_mega-catch-cup-great-league-edition/
