BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:minior-showers-eta-aquariids-2027@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261126T235103Z
SUMMARY:Minior Showers: Eta Aquariids 2027
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20270503T170000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20270508T235900
DESCRIPTION:Explore by starlight during the Eta Aquariids meteor shower for
  a chance to encounter Minior in Pokémon GO!\nThis Minior Shower runs fro
 m May 3\, 2027 at 5:00 p.m. to May 8\, 2027 at 11:59 p.m. local time.\n\n
 ━━ BONUSES ━━\n• Increased Stardust for catching Minior\n• Inc
 reased chance to encounter Minior from 5:00 p.m. to 9:00 p.m. local time e
 ach day\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Minior Cores\nMinior has seven diff
 erent core colors: Red\, Orange\, Yellow\, Green\, Blue\, Indigo\, and Vio
 let. A different core color will debut during each of the six meteor showe
 rs listed below. During the Geminids\, one core color will debut in the No
 rthern Hemisphere and another in the Southern Hemisphere.\nPokémon: Minio
 r (Red Core)\, Minior (Orange Core)\, Minior (Yellow Core)\, Minior (Green
  Core)\, Minior (Blue Core)\, Minior (Indigo Core)\, Minior (Violet Core)\
 nGreen Core Minior debuted during the Orionids\, and Yellow Core Minior de
 buts during the Leonids. The core colors for the remaining meteor showers 
 have not been announced.\n\n▸ Explore by Starlight\nFrom 5:00 p.m. to 9:
 00 p.m. local time every day during each Minior Shower\, shooting stars wi
 ll light up the in-game sky. During these hours\, you’ll have an increas
 ed chance of encountering Minior in the wild!\n\n▸ Minior’s Form Chang
 es\nMinior begins battles in its Meteor Form. When its health drops below 
 50%\, it changes form and exposes its core.\n• Meteor Form: Higher Defen
 se and lower Attack.\n• Core exposed: Higher Attack and lower Defense.\n
 Initially\, Minior will only be able to change forms when battling Team GO
  Rocket\, team leaders\, or in the GO Battle League.\nMinior will not be e
 ligible for the 2027 Latin America International Championships.\n\n▸ Ann
 ual Meteor Shower Schedule\nMinior can appear during the following meteor 
 showers each year. Each shower begins at 5:00 p.m. on its first day and en
 ds at 11:59 p.m. on its last day\, in local time.\n• Orionids: October 1
 9–24\, 2026\n• Leonids: November 14–19\, 2026\n• Geminids: Decembe
 r 11–16\, 2026\n• Eta Aquariids: May 3–8\, 2027\n• Southern Delta 
 Aquariids: July 28–August 2\, 2027\n• Perseids: August 10–15\, 2027\
 n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━\n▸ Wild Encounters\nYou may encounter Minior in 
 its Meteor Form in the wild during the event. You’ll receive 1\,000 Star
 dust for catching Minior.\nPokémon: Minior (Meteor Form)\nMinior encounte
 rs are more likely from 5:00 p.m. to 9:00 p.m. local time each day.\n\n
 🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/minior-showers-eta-aquariids-2027/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/minior-showers-eta-aquariids-2027/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
